<title>USA: Cinergy awards 100-megawatt option contract.</title>
<headline>Cinergy awards 100-megawatt option contract.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CINergy Corp said it awarded a 100-megawatt option contract for electric power purchases to LG&amp;E Energy Corp's LG&amp;E Power Marketing Inc unit.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The contract is for up to 100 megawatts of summer peaking between 1997 and 2002, the company said.</p>
<p>The contract is part of a request for proposal that CINergy issued last spring, CINergy said.</p>
<p>The deal helps the company defer the need to build new power generation facilities, it added.</p>
</text>
